orrower is\\nnotified, not the day the item arrived.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A explicitly states day one is not the day the item arrived.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Sweep the shelf every morning before opening.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states the shelf is swept every morning before opening.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Items past 7 days go back into\\ncirculation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A sends items back to circulation unless there is a next borrower, which is the claim reworded.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Items past 7 days go back into\\ncirculation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states overdue items go to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A borrower who asks before the 7 days are up can have the item held for a further\\n7 days.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states the extension of a further 7 days when asked before expiry.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"This is granted once per request.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states the extension is granted once per request.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back\\nto the shelves\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states an item uncollected twice goes back to the shelves.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the request is cancelled\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states 